title: 'Not reported: the hides of a save whose rerender is withheld, and what merges, restores and delete propagation add.'
pid: 2795efd8-dbb4-4884-bb0a-08138dbfb976
body: |2-
  A save on a restricted connection whose rerender would show
  overPrivateText text is answered by a confirmation, not a save-result,
  and the release that follows carries no hides; the hides are written
  unannounced. Mending it means carrying the lines through
  'update_views_after_save' and each client's release handler. Merges,
  restore requests and delete propagation run after the plan, which is
  what the lines compare.
